    "name": "LAPSE",
    "overview": "Sync subtitles that have drifted out of time. Open Settings after installing to set it up.",
    "description": "Lines up subtitles against a film or episode's audio, or against another subtitle file, using the LAPSE alignment engine. Adds a Sync Subtitles button to the item context menu, a dashboard for bulk syncing and engine setup, auto sync for newly added media, and manual fine tuning for when a sync lands close but not perfect. After installing, open the plugin from Dashboard, Plugins, LAPSE to install the engine and configure it. Nothing syncs until you do.",
